  "ingredients": [
    "4 slices bacon",
    "3 green onions, chopped",
    "2 cloves garlic, chopped",
    "2 (15 ounce) cans green beans, drained",
    "1 (14.5 ounce) can Italian-style diced tomatoes",
    "1 pinch dried basil",
    "1 pinch dried oregano",
    "0.25 cup brown sugar"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook bacon in a skillet over medium heat until crisp. Remove from the pan to drain on paper towels.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jhIlL4-shU3NarqNfhJPlG9iQmg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/148638-sweet-italian-green-beans-DDMFS-step-01-3c3583816d7b48e5971ecff059b9d4b3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/148638/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reserve the grease in the skillet and add the onions; cook and stir over medium heat until softened. Add garlic and cook for about 30 seconds more. Remove from the heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/d68iJhd8Ha-r5N8iFwnN3AP8lZc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/148638-sweet-italian-green-beans-DDMFS-step-02-0a1421cf0e02430fbf2851f9df6eeee2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/148638/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a saucepan, combine the green beans, tomatoes, basil, oregano and brown sugar.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6O57lMnw48unrJNrzMozEq52v94=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/148638-sweet-italian-green-beans-DDMFS-step-03-179965a590db4b87ba434b43d22d0b7c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/148638/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Crumble in the bacon and add the onion and garlic from the skillet. Warm over medium heat until heated through, 5 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BxhuZF1UlSh-ezWtVUm4RZNR6Dc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/148638-sweet-italian-green-beans-DDMFS-step-04-00e507334bca4bada6f4651249b485af.jpg"
